- Add **Specific CO Factor** input group (similar to CO2, CH4).
- Add Unit selector for CO (kg/m³, lb/MMBtu, etc.).

### 3. Logic ([emissions-calc.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/emissions-calc.js))
- Update [addRecord](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/h/public/emissions-calc.js#167-379) to:
